# Role in the Lab

Splunk Enterprise receives telemetry generated by Windows endpoints.

The incoming data is indexed and becomes searchable through the Search & Reporting application.

Collected telemetry includes:

- Security Logs
- System Logs
- Application Logs
- Sysmon Events

These logs will later be used for:

- Threat Hunting
- Detection Engineering
- Incident Response
- Malware Investigation

